title: Remove the stale pallet-people and pallet-dummy-dim crates
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `pallet-people` and `pallet-dummy-dim` are unused: development of pallet-people continued in
    `paritytech/individuality-community`, and nothing in this repo or in
    `polkadot-fellows/runtimes` depends on either crate anymore. Removes both.
crates: []
